&lt;p&gt;Itto, a young woman from a modest rural background, is slowly adapting to the Moroccan privileged codes of her husband&amp;rsquo;s family. But when supernatural events put the country in a state of emergency, Itto finds herself separated from her husband and new family. Alone, pregnant and looking for her way back, she finds emancipation.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Watch the trailer &lt;a href="https://youtu.be/N1L2pU_Osxs?si=7shoFoiMY__88cT1"&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you want sleight-of-hand cinematic atmosphere, a big movie made on a small budget, and a sense of the planet tipping on its axis toward destruction and rebirth, here&amp;#39;s your vision of the end times. - Ty Burr of Substack (Top Critic)&lt;/p&gt;
